SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE
---------------------

The MIT Licence below covers Team Nootropia's work in this repository: everything in nootropia/
(source code, documentation and the trained models in nootropia/models/), docs/ and README.md.

It does NOT cover:

- games.py, evaluation/possession_metrics.py and starter/, copied unchanged from Metrica Sports'
  challenge repository and licensed by them under their own MIT licence: see LICENSE-metrica;
- the match data of the competition, which is not in this repository and is licensed for the
  competition only;
- the DFL/IDSSE open data the models were trained on (Bassek et al. 2025, CC-BY 4.0), which is not
  in this repository either.

